[issue.1742]
number = 1742
title = "[Coherence] The commit message describes three code changes that the commit does not contain"
revision = "a910fdedd579e63379ae6c2e4d4971990d28f8ad"
verdict = "not-relevant"
evidence = "Commit 606adc9dcfa0c272b2969e78d9ab6c5002e16fc5 indeed changed only GOTCHA.kvx, qualification.kvx and spec.kvx, but its missing implementations were superseded by commits 6c2ecdfc08b6cba1247357f08babe6787026faf5 (programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/src/queries.rs:931 checks emptiness before decoding, with the retained NotYetProduced assertion at programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/view_binding.rs:332), 101f526f032f95aa585c3458967dae66f1bb053c (tests/programs/test_ai_host_boundary.c:380 prints both result codes and programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/host_boundary.rs:529 includes both in assertion diagnostics), and 37f0bdbb057ae4e3b95571debc5703898322922c (services/agent/qualification/pay2/tests/support/funded_peer.rs:721 derives grant and draw logs from the construct method, verified at services/agent/qualification/pay2/tests/support/funded_scenario.rs:454), with spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:9003 replacing ledger-specific receipt header words with node transaction fields and verified precompile logs."
close_comment = "The historical commit subject overstated a specification-only change, but subsequent commits supply the market availability and native result diagnostics repairs. Grant and draw outcomes now follow the superseding receipt contract: verified ledger precompile logs with node transaction fields in the receipt header."
